⍝ ---------- helpers ----------
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

                                                           ⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝
U16←{256 256⊤⍵}                                            ⍝ 16-bit number big endian same as htons
SkipName←{l←⍺[⍵] ⋄ l=0:⍵+1 ⋄ l≥192:⍵+2 ⋄ ⍺ ∇ ⍵+1+l}        ⍝ msg SkipName pos after a DNS name
IPv4←{1↓∊'.',¨⍕¨⍵}                                         ⍝ 4 bytes "a.b.c.d"
Hex←{d←16 16 16 16⊤⍵ ⋄ '0123456789abcdef'[(3⌊+/∧\0=d)↓d]}  ⍝ 0..65535 hex without leading zeros
Join←{1↓∊':',¨⍵}                                           ⍝ list of strings -> "a:b:c"
Words←{(~⍵∊' ',⎕UCS 9)⊆⍵}                                  ⍝ split a line into words (spaces or tabs)
                                                           ⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

