⍝ DNS response code text
RcodeText←{⍵=3:'name does not exist (NXDOMAIN)' ⋄ ⍵=2:'server failure (SERVFAIL)' ⋄ ⍵=5:'query refused (REFUSED)' ⋄ 'error code ',⍕⍵}


